@host = http://localhost:3000

### health check
GET {{host}}/health

### unknown route -> 404 json
GET {{host}}/nope

### list expenses (empty at first)
GET {{host}}/expenses

### create an expense
# @name createExpense
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "lunch",
  "amountPence": 1000,
  "paidBy": "Alice",
  "splitBetween": ["Alice", "Bob"]
}

### create another expense with an uneven split (exercises remainder distribution)
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "taxi",
  "amountPence": 1001,
  "paidBy": "Bob",
  "splitBetween": ["Alice", "Bob", "Carol"]
}

### list expenses again -> should include both above
GET {{host}}/expenses

### balances -> net position per person
GET {{host}}/balances

### validation error: empty body -> 400 with issues
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### validation error: duplicate person in splitBetween -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "groceries",
  "amountPence": 500,
  "paidBy": "Alice",
  "splitBetween": ["Alice", "Alice"]
}

### validation error: non-integer / non-positive amount -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "bad amount",
  "amountPence": -5,
  "paidBy": "Alice",
  "splitBetween": ["Alice"]
}

### validation error: unknown/extra field rejected (strictObject) -> 400
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "extra field",
  "amountPence": 100,
  "paidBy": "Alice",
  "splitBetween": ["Alice"],
  "note": "not allowed"
}

### malformed json body -> 400, not a 500
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

not json
